WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.436
Canada Disability Benefit.

00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:04.613
Two hundred dollars per month.

00:00:04.613 --> 00:00:06.739
Below the poverty line.

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:12.795
The government announced the Canada Disability Benefit as transformational support for Canadians with disabilities.

00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:18.227
When the regulations were finally published, the maximum amount was two hundred dollars per month.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:23.988
The poverty line for a single person in Canada is approximately twenty-two thousand dollars per year.

00:00:23.988 --> 00:00:27.965
Two hundred dollars per month is twenty-four hundred dollars per year.

00:00:27.965 --> 00:00:33.693
Meanwhile, the same government expanded MAID eligibility for people with disabilities under Track 2.

00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:35.227
The numbers.

00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:37.454
Two hundred dollars per month.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.022
Twenty-four hundred dollars per year.

00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:45.454
The poverty line for a single person: approximately twenty-two thousand dollars per year.

00:00:45.454 --> 00:00:50.409
The Canada Disability Benefit covers ten point nine percent of the poverty threshold.

00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:54.556
A MAID procedure costs approximately twenty-five hundred dollars.

00:00:54.556 --> 00:01:00.022
The annual disability benefit is less than the cost of the lethal injection that ends the need for it.

00:01:00.022 --> 00:01:01.704
The convergence.

00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:11.931
A government that funds death at twenty-five hundred dollars per procedure but funds disability support at two hundred dollars per month has made a mathematical choice about the value of disabled lives.

00:01:11.931 --> 00:01:25.431
When the same political apparatus simultaneously expands MAID eligibility for disabilities and sets the disability benefit below the poverty line, the policy architecture is aligned: it is cheaper and easier to die than to live with a disability in Canada.

00:01:25.431 --> 00:01:27.670
This is not an oversight.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.454
It is arithmetic.
